flowchart LR
  subgraph D[Departments]
    C1[RTSP / WHEP / HLS cameras]
    C2[Existing VMS]
  end
  C1 --> G1[Regional gateway A]
  C2 --> G2[Regional gateway B]
  subgraph R[Regional inference domain]
    G1 --> W1[Worker shard 1]
    G2 --> W2[Worker shard 2]
    W1 --> BUS[Regional event bus]
    W2 --> BUS
    BUS --> RP[Regional PostGIS primary/standby]
    BUS --> RO[Regional evidence store]
  end
  RP --> CP[Central control plane]
  RO --> CP
  CP --> API[API replicas / WebSocket]
  API --> UI[Department and state dashboards]
  MON[Monitoring / audit / alerting] --> G1
  MON --> W1
  MON --> CP
